{"meta":{"id":"tt38960812","type":"series","name":"¡Nos vemos en la oficina!","imdb_id":"tt38960812","description":"Cha Ji-yoon lleva 7 años trabajando en el mundo corporativo y está cansada del trabajo y de las citas. Kang Si-woo, un cínico jefe con mala reputación, se cruza en su camino. De forma inesperada, ella recupera la ilusión al ver la bondad detrás de sus duras palabras. En medio de trayectos al trabajo, accidentes laborales y relaciones fallidas, ambos se convierten en el principal apoyo del otro.","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt38960812.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zftF4KDGuhAGIA50bywcCXPjz5f.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1hbP4uqhJVYa0DbVOiUz291WdJO.png","genres":["Comedia","Drama"],"releaseInfo":"2026","released":"2026-06-22T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Ended","imdbRating":"7.1","country":"South Korea","cast":["서인국","박지현","강미나","원규빈","Choi Kyung-hoon","한태하","김정영","강기둥","이재이","한재훈","염승이"],"director":["조은솔"],"writer":["McQueen Studio"],"trailers":[{"source":"kBGgK8F3CSU","type":"Trailer","name":"Official Trailer [Subtitled]","ytId":"kBGgK8F3CSU","lang":"en"}],"trailerStreams":[{"ytId":"kBGgK8F3CSU","title":"Official Trailer [Subtitled]"}],"links":[{"name":"7.1","category":"imdb","url":"https://imdb.com/title/tt38960812"},{"name":"Comedia","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///discover/https%3A%2F%2Fv3-cinemeta.strem.io%2Fmanifest.json/series/top?genre=Comedia"},{"name":"Drama","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///discover/https%3A%2F%2Fv3-cinemeta.strem.io%2Fmanifest.json/series/top?genre=Drama"},{"name":"서인국","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=%EC%84%9C%EC%9D%B8%EA%B5%AD"},{"name":"박지현","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=%EB%B0%95%EC%A7%80%ED%98%84"},{"name":"강미나","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=%EA%B0%95%EB%AF%B8%EB%82%98"},{"name":"원규빈","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=%EC%9B%90%EA%B7%9C%EB%B9%8