or good with Ga-eul, but Ji-yoon still clocks in. Her dynamic with Si-woo shifts leading up to the 'sphere ice refrigerator' presentation.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eWGgjlD25GXpzw4wEPkqNh4BXIW.jpg","released":"2026-06-30T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"70 min"},{"id":"tt38960812:1:5","season":1,"episode":5,"title":"Episodio 5","overview":"Ji-yoon feels uneasy seeing Si-woo and Soo-jin close, but an accidental find at his place leaves her confused. Later, No-ah sets her up on a date.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1cr5uYsHn0ONCUgOiIDRrV5RryZ.jpg","released":"2026-07-06T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"69 min"},{"id":"tt38960812:1:6","season":1,"episode":6,"title":"Episodio 6","overview":"To suppress her feelings for Si-woo, Ji-yoon tries to leave the task force. But when he refuses to let her go, they develop feelings hard to ignore.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1H5N2kfaxiRSrtJORcZt5cBzl7m.jpg","released":"2026-07-07T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"69 min"},{"id":"tt38960812:1:7","season":1,"episode":7,"title":"Episodio 7","overview":"Ji-yoon and Si-woo start a secret romance. As the line between work and love blurs, Ga-eul reappears before a struggling Ji-yoon.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5d0xy3LuMoLMEkkswkdCtz2J7jy.jpg","released":"2026-07-13T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"69 min"},{"id":"tt38960812:1:8","season":1,"episode":8,"title":"Episodio 8","overview":"As the romance deepens, unvoiced thoughts and secrets grow. Meanwhile, Si-woo's failure to show up on Hye-ji's wedding leaves Ji-yoon anxious.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zVglPgZaaNQeyyCm9ARlhRa0R6Z.jpg","released":"2026-07-14T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"69 min"},{"id":"tt38960812:1:9","season":1,"episode":9,"title":"Episodio 9","overview":"When Ji-yoon asks for some time, Si-woo takes Seong-min's advice and lingers near. Meanwhile, Home-AI demo day arrives, and so does the Demo Ghost!","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xkN1DyWSzyHzfdS8lUXK2txnG8h.jpg","released":"2026-07-20T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"70 min"},{"id":"tt38960812:1:10","season":1,"episode":10,"title":"Episodio 10","overview":"While an unexpected event forces Ji-yoon to stay at Si-woo's, settling them into life's simple joys, her promotion sends Mr. Ko's envy spiraling.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fYq4Cd9mZbDfyQIvWKDpDjonw6o.jpg","released":"2026-07-21T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"70 min"},{"id":"tt38960812:1:11","season":1,"episode":11,"title":"Episodio 11","overview":"Ji-yoon goes public to protect Si-woo, but intense public scrutiny backfires on them. Left with no choice, Si-woo makes a grave decision.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wtaMCaUVoQPo9QC3QPgybZbhneL.jpg","released":"2026-07-27T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"69 min"},{"id":"tt38960812:1:12","season":1,"episode":12,"title":"Episodio 12","overview":"As Ji-yoon struggles with Si-woo's decision, Hye-gyeong discovers their romance. Will the two safely clock in for work tomorrow, and for love?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8ENuVuYqmJebktXnaJzzUrraTjd.jpg","released":"2026-07-28T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"70 min"}]}}